WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.426
KATY
Hey, can we get real for a second?

00:00:03.477 --> 00:00:05.117
We've been friends for ten years.

00:00:05.742 --> 00:00:08.430
I know that you don't
like to talk about your life...

00:00:08.481 --> 00:00:13.889
But a guy with a freakin' machete for
an arm just chopped our bus in half!

00:00:15.842 --> 00:00:18.771
♫ ["Run It" by DJ Snake
feat. Rick Ross and Rich Brian] ♫

00:00:21.216 --> 00:00:22.185
KATY
Who are you?

00:00:22.236 --> 00:00:24.345
♫ (Run it) Only talkin'
Makin' major moves ♫

00:00:24.396 --> 00:00:25.495
SHANG-CHI
My father trained me to be

00:00:25.545 --> 00:00:26.982
the Ten Rings' greatest weapon.

00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:29.075
♫ On the road to riches
I could never lay around ♫

00:00:29.709 --> 00:00:31.057
SHANG-CHI
But that's not who I am.

00:00:31.599 --> 00:00:33.857
♫ Me against the world
I got my back against the wall ♫

00:00:34.396 --> 00:00:35.953
SHANG-CHI
How did you find me?

00:00:36.802 --> 00:00:38.752
WENWU
I always know where my children are.

00:00:38.802 --> 00:00:41.291
♫ Me against the world
I got my back against the wall ♫

00:00:41.857 --> 00:00:43.168
KATY
Seems like a nice fella.

00:00:43.396 --> 00:00:44.396
♪♪

00:00:44.803 --> 00:00:45.987
SHANG-CHI
It's time to show the world...

00:00:46.037 --> 00:00:48.268
♫ Know I'm hell bound
But I'm well now ♫

00:00:48.318 --> 00:00:49.323
SHANG-CHI
...who I really am.

00:00:49.373 --> 00:00:51.802
♫ No one will ever stop me ♫

00:00:54.724 --> 00:00:56.951
♫ Everybody scream
Everybody scream ♫

00:00:57.002 --> 00:00:58.760
♫ That's my only thing, yes
I'm a born winner ♫

00:00:58.810 --> 00:00:59.596
SHANG-CHI
Come on!

00:00:59.646 --> 00:01:00.825
♪ A Jordan 23 (Woo!) ♪

00:01:00.896 --> 00:01:02.568
KATY
Oh, hell no! I'm not doing that!

00:01:02.646 --> 00:01:05.406
♪♪

00:01:07.755 --> 00:01:09.205
YING NAN
You are a product of all

00:01:09.255 --> 00:01:10.588
who came before you.

00:01:11.216 --> 00:01:14.618
♫ (Gun it) I bought a 'Rari and I did it
Just to hear the sound ♫

00:01:14.669 --> 00:01:16.994
♫ Drive safe really 'bout to
Lose all its meaning now ♫

00:01:17.388 --> 00:01:18.661
SHANG-CHI
If I die, it's your fault.

00:01:18.983 --> 00:01:21.756
♫ Say you're married to the game
And I'm just here to burn the gown ♫

00:01:22.155 --> 00:01:23.573
SHANG-CHI
I must stop him.

00:01:23.623 --> 00:01:24.690
KATY
Hell yeah.

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:29.756
♫ Around with homies like we run the city
Lookin' fresh and feelin' like a milli ♫

00:01:30.185 --> 00:01:34.344
♫ Move in silence you can never hear me
If you got a problem when you see me ♫

00:01:34.873 --> 00:01:39.385
♫ Bang, tryna show you
What we came to do ♫

00:01:39.435 --> 00:01:41.977
♫ Boss, only talkin',
Makin' major moves ♫

00:01:42.771 --> 00:01:45.287
SHANG-CHI
My name is Shang-Chi.

00:01:45.641 --> 00:01:46.497
KATY
Shawn Chee.

00:01:46.547 --> 00:01:48.684
- Shang.
- Shun.

00:01:48.734 --> 00:01:50.223
SHANG-CHI
S-H-A-N-G. Shang.

00:01:50.273 --> 00:01:51.336
KATY
That's what I said.

00:01:52.049 --> 00:01:53.226
KATY
Oh, you're gonna turn it up?

00:01:53.276 --> 00:01:54.249
Yeah, you can hear me.

00:01:54.299 --> 00:01:55.299
♫ Run it ♫

00:02:01.164 --> 00:02:02.164
♫ Run it ♫

